Build a premium, modern Persian bakery website UI as a frontend-only prototype.

IMPORTANT:

* This is ONLY a visual UI prototype for showing to a client.
* Do NOT build any backend.
* Do NOT add Payload CMS.
* Do NOT add a database.
* Do NOT add authentication.
* Do NOT create APIs.
* Use realistic mock data.
* Focus heavily on visual quality, layout, typography, spacing, illustration, responsiveness, and overall first impression.
* The result must look like a professionally designed production website, not an AI-generated generic template.

## Project Setup

Scaffold a NEW Next.js 16 project (App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS v4).

* Tailwind v4 uses CSS-based configuration via the `@theme` directive in
  `src/app/globals.css`. Do NOT create `tailwind.config.ts` or
  `tailwind.config.js` — those are v3 and will not work.
* Set the path alias `@/*` to `./src/*` in tsconfig.json.
* Do not install a component library (no shadcn/ui, MUI, Chakra). Hand-roll the
  components with Tailwind.
* Do not install unnecessary dependencies.

