* Keep components clean and reusable.
* Create a sensible component structure under `src/components/`.
* Server components by default; only use `'use client'` for genuinely
  interactive pieces (mobile nav, gallery lightbox).
* Do not over-engineer.
* `pnpm build` and `pnpm lint` must pass.

