Before reporting the work as finished:

* Run `pnpm build` and `pnpm lint` and fix any errors.
* Confirm every illustration renders — no broken image icons or empty slots.
* Confirm every image path is driven from `src/data/content.ts`, not inline.
* Check the layout at 375px, 768px and 1280px.
* Check RTL: nothing mirrored, text aligned to the right, mobile drawer opening
